proposal = "Add per-instance inventory rendering under services/interop/deploy/bridge-relayer and bind BRIDGE_SIGNER_KEYS generation to each attestor index and key mount. Validate all five rendered deployments against docker/bridge-relayer/entrypoint.sh without reading or exposing private keys."
